  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Anne Briggs</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-5621 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-anne-briggs\" id=\"post-5621\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/anne-briggs/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"364\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman sitting at a table with a cake in front of her.\" src=\"/media/archive/db6248483715d867ff4125842520e28c5a4ac2d8c8e81f39b0fbab66ad8fbc7e.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/anne-briggs/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Anne Briggs</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-02-16T12:34:40-05:00\" title=\"Tuesday, February 16, 2021, 12:34 pm\">February 16, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Anne Briggs, who was a GHA member and a Gallery participant for a number of years, passed away at her home in Arlington, MA.  Anne grew up in Attleboro and spent summers in Harwich Port.  She loved the beach and everything the Cape had to offer.  Anne was an award-winning artist at the Cape Cod Art Center, the Creative Art Center as well as in the Arlington area.  </p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4037 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-events category-gallery-artists category-news tag-anne-briggs tag-brian-powers tag-cape-cod-art-center tag-doris-mee tag-larry-folding tag-martha-little-fuentes\" id=\"post-4037\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/the-all-new-england-opens-at-the-cape-cod-art-center/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"386\" height=\"500\" alt=\"All new england 2018 exhibit flyer.\" src=\"/media/archive/90629c140aa39b3390f0386483f0b1bbf3caa77e12db9541b5b9aa4095ea6b4d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/the-all-new-england-opens-at-the-cape-cod-art-center/\" rel=\"bookmark\">The All New England Opens at the Cape Cod Art Center</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-10-11T16:18:08-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, October 11, 2018, 4:18 pm\">October 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Cape Cod Art Center, Barnstable Mass announced acceptance of artists in their Annual Juried Show, “The All New England” Guild members whose work will be exhibited: Anne Briggs, Larry <a href=\"/news/the-all-new-england-opens-at-the-cape-cod-art-center/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4014 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-the-gallery category-news tag-anne-briggs tag-cape-cod-chamber-orchestra tag-carroll-sivco tag-erica-dale-strzepek tag-music-through-art\" id=\"post-4014\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/composer-in-residence-francis-snyder-discusses-his-inspiration/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"499\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Erica-Strzepek, Hold Space\" src=\"/media/archive/3a3463cc33c6d65048712a8b34522fb98b3c6c7b6a1c70040e9a13b152f120e5.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/composer-in-residence-francis-snyder-discusses-his-inspiration/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Composer-in-Residence Francis Snyder Discusses His Inspiration</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-09-20T16:51:56-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, September 20, 2018, 4:51 pm\">September 20, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Cape Cod Chamber Orchestra (CCCO) launches its inaugural season with Music Through Art, an immersive collaboration of art and music, on Sunday, September 30, 3 pm, at Pilgrim Congregational Church, <a href=\"/news/composer-in-residence-francis-snyder-discusses-his-inspiration/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3964 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-events category-news tag-anne-briggs tag-cape-cod-chamber-orchestra tag-carroll-sivco tag-erica-dale-strzepek tag-francis-snyder tag-laura-balboni tag-matthew-scinto\" id=\"post-3964\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/music-through-art-collaboration-with-cape-cod-chamber-orchestra/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"811\" height=\"315\" alt=\"A close-up of a logo.\" src=\"/media/archive/0a1582bcb790750417f2222bdbd281c72946f922540a45ca4b175af6eb9f0ed6.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/music-through-art-collaboration-with-cape-cod-chamber-orchestra/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Music Through Art – Collaboration with Cape Cod Chamber Orchestra</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-09-03T14:03:55-04:00\" title=\"Monday, September 3, 2018, 2:03 pm\">September 3, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Cape Cod Chamber Orchestra (CCCO), the region’s newest professional orchestra, announces Navigations, its inaugural full season of four performances, launching with Music Through Art, an immersive collaboration of art and <a href=\"/news/music-through-art-collaboration-with-cape-cod-chamber-orchestra/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3924 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-gallery-artists category-news tag-anne-briggs tag-cape-cod-art-center\" id=\"post-3924\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/anne-briggs-exhibits-in-the-national-exhibit/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"386\" height=\"500\" alt=\"The national 2018 exhibit flyer.\" src=\"/media/archive/9a1d708b9d5eba74c54847aef9201fb22e4f000efc18b192fecb484cbda70df3.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/anne-briggs-exhibits-in-the-national-exhibit/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Anne Briggs Exhibits in “The National 2018 Exhibit”</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-10T11:45:00-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, July 10, 2018, 11:45 am\">July 10, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild of Harwich Artist Anne Briggs will exhibit in the Cape Cod Art Center’s “The National 2018 Exhibit” which runs July 16 – August 12. Her piece “Spring Thing 3” <a href=\"/news/anne-briggs-exhibits-in-the-national-exhibit/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3907 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists tag-anne-briggs tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-free-demonstration tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3907\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/july-14-meet-the-artist/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"347\" height=\"500\" alt=\"©Anne Briggs, Arborlines\" src=\"/media/archive/e88f8485eeb4c1ebd97747f5cdec4fa5ea9a12a0b267dd3166427c921f791feb.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/july-14-meet-the-artist/\" rel=\"bookmark\">July 14 Meet The Artist</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-30T14:45:58-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, June 30, 2018, 2:45 pm\">June 30, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Visit the Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists on Saturday, July 14 for a free demonstration of how to paint trees with watercolor on yupo paper, a plastic medium that <a href=\"/news/july-14-meet-the-artist/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"n